  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening SDG 4 Coordination, Monitoring &amp; Reporting in Egypt</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Egypt, significant strides have been achieved in increasing awareness around the SDG4-Education 2030 agenda. However, more work needs to be done in terms of building national capacities to monitor and report progress against SDG4 and closing gaps in data and statistics. It is against this context that UNESCO Cairo will continue to support the validation and implementation of a national roadmap to address SDG4-related data gaps and challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
